sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant N as Neovim
    participant P as mermaid-viewer
    participant M as mmdr
    participant T as Terminal

    U->>N: :MermaidView
    N->>P: view()
    P->>P: extract source
    P->>M: render(source, opts)
    M-->>P: PNG file
    P->>T: Kitty transmit
    P->>T: Kitty display
    T-->>U: Diagram visible

    U->>P: zoom in (+)
    P->>M: re-render (higher res)
    M-->>P: PNG file
    P->>T: transmit + display
    T-->>U: Zoomed diagram
